2i9CR-qd8EdxSXpGlQ1qVk90p_MrP/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">不完備情報の動学ゲーム</a>\n\n練習問題<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ncbREMBgZtAx1Mo4HLn7XK92xLDsv_P8/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">応用例と後ろ向き帰納法</a>（2025.05.07追加）<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/12qMOxuEyXx6-f3P4uTFg3TAO9O5qtReL/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">同時手番ゲーム</a>（2025.05.07追加）<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/19rssTMhhXnJSHdYkpKFXRTdQFRgU7WWJ/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">展開形ゲームと繰り返しゲーム</a>（2025.06.23追加）<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1PauxSh7GtZAVy-cfgP3GujaWGUIAY2aq/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">不完備情報のゲーム</a>（2025.06.23追加）<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Cfrs_nTcmDFdYQCMGusp6nyYG2SrgPn0/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">動学ベイジアンゲーム</a>（2025.06.23追加）\n\n解答例<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1w7SOSL2YzROujkJ2R8xPUvEY4oTzk14m/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">応用例と後ろ向き帰納法</a>（2025.06.18追加）<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1FQB-0oklerEveCHlP3fN5Z9IX-ZorV2x/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">同時手番ゲーム</a>（2025.06.18追加）<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gcLafpvY-8bcR9ZetDowigBbJxR7IjKU/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">展開形ゲームと繰り返しゲーム</a>（2025.07.15修正版）<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Rk4hhXUbvhIX91f5GXqxJf6VJKrCPH40/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">不完備情報のゲーム</a>（2025.07.08追加）<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BRQ6zPaJmfK6lN7Ni5qNUPul7BEwGVw2/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">動学ベイジアンゲーム</a>（2025.07.08追加）\n\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QccX84-vQcnbeA-WZn7kcK2hR9RMXNEL/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">模擬試験問題</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/17E6uA6yEXMAF6cfoF-JOkUMtMe3WOwfG/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">解答例</a>\n\n\n## Microeconomics I (2025 Spring)\n\n<strong>Introduction</strong><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10he7LmBVAlcOM6ICKuGcfzbenxhTsEev/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10k9iFzZv6-rgx5jVo19fWkCe3K_pLH0x/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Japanese</a><br>\n\n<strong>Economy and Markets</strong><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jFxn-WpRtQcuLM-L3VPG8yXSDLJR7oQ7/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/15xGx5Di9AiDguTBC44Mlm5d0XcrHfnGl/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Japanese</a><br>\n\n<strong>Producer Theory</strong><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1I9mS7zc7cGzwbBlOPnHjnkaMB-m-tMag/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ery5E3CEVqv9jn0MpDklNuOHkxclkjKk/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Japanese</a><br>\n\n<strong>Consumer Theory</strong><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1isgi_WKkb67-k6LcwCCidTScZ9t3kWcu/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1atTNliv8E7jfm7Xr3t64LJAf6Ov3EkrQ/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Japanese</a><br>\n\n<strong>Partial Equilibrium Analysis</strong><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gX0sxD710embqUIxMxsbPmGL569H0zH3/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Wd4dsJdzV0EiEBSgvHueFIImKzzp04pI/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Japanese</a><br>\n\n<strong>General Equilibrium Analysis</strong><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BaMkltTibm2oQSqgCD3rRx0tiOuRahyH/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1aTQrYh_9MYyrLpOhIASPEMGGpCxqUchU/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Japanese</a><br>\n\n<strong>Market Failures</strong><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QvZgH9QlDyS5C6dWq3Aj_BT2M5UR9Gvr/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1594q4NgJdMsWUFimziKb_g8SonhyR9Zv/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Japanese</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_Yye3eeT-q4bQb3RlIrUqpx3zt-IkOx4/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Problem Sets</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mdTS43v_TLTsJlLcMWKbh14f-TQcrlWb/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Solutions</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BiBKeOrI1xfTKeCdvmfaOVsxD5ZS4kuv/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Mock Exam</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ywTDwjoSgHIvTtRWE09oWHy4ClZLPZRz/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Solutions</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zq_hgJuOWzEbqZwNNW0zq62QCEqW8MxN/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Final Exam in 2024</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jCobaXxseD41sjI8V1USeKcnPw-T52Cc/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Solutions</a>\n\n\n## 2024F Microeconomics II (Undergrad)\n\nDecision under Uncertainty<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10y-AAc0f7uPvAIjRKH3oVmFWItNJ1wDc/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1GqXu-7DS3QlDor-hfgQw5mqEuP0nzAj7/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Japanese</a>\n\nEconomics of Information<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1EfxRYNl9oEnpo6N1LyhnDRs6qkA2tieY/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1VxmXNZl2iVrMNKZi7dzkkjo8cfXhEl8J/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Japanese</a>\n\nGame Theory: Introduction<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1L5JDRMXiPmpcMmrd0LlH7XzYcDh2_Hqp/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1bqXgrpfm3niU9TOZOvpHeMAbJXzyX98f/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Japanese</a>\n\nStatic Games<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10Wx7dzkMO1bpohOU-8xKlCPWskfnw56D/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1EFpyWQgewJp0jmnLmXBXfqOg20b76wOr/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Japanese</a>\n\nDynamic Games<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mu0VLIPR0HgNrGOSSpSfzmqV5TZ57xbC/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oDiKVXqKYf8YJAuFAiQkCdAQqUCqm7oC/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Japanese</a>\n\nRepeated Games<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TAQ0MQF7DVy2_G_j-wecVmZQ4Ogv0E7w/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1fp1Ce7WXIK4MNZcnYsF0lfCWmlRP1Qmz/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Japanese</a>\n\nGames with Incomplete Information<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Ve3clsr__NZJBNljFmmt0Bm521PGTVsN/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1M06TvVnazxtbIcRNYc9UxKqulwa3SNRv/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Japanese</a>\n\nDynamic Games with Incomplete Information<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1phHr_D_PLpvyPzZc_7ZnOF8zSdHyDMOZ/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zX6320ghCf2FKO5_OSp6qmhmZHt-qEQX/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Japanese</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1FOYZboEZNtaeBPL8ndssafN--0jA1RKE/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Decision under Uncertainty</a> (updated on Oct. 23)<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gqmVFzSHUk6_4Dden1VaIwPACHkdaaZa/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">solution</a> (updated on Oct. 24)\n\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wT-hL6DPLjDRQ-DJLHHi-U2bszFjwzLB/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Game Theory: Introduction</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/15N_KQelwuVZw_TOxW55s-s4C363nfm0a/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">solution</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1eraICdHIOUSZmiHv3zhyFHTv9HqKA8sW/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Strategic-Form Games</a> (updated on Dec. 4)<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1kSdSykOaA_nFuUGr9ieKwkqY88CtKJG3/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">solution</a> (updated on Dec. 11)\n\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mPvE8TPul6MVQpX8WXqz8dtdGhlnzyD2/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Dynamic Games</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oTk0ZX-rTMb_s4YSrNmf7IcSGlZSFlv0/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">solution</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/12Nte8_47LpkjxFnOnN1L3QpGQ0fjqT8E/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Repeated Games</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1C4u6E60qcgGa6wmivxlH2_Co9qUQ0lwX/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">solution</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iogOQABQLXRc7G3Bb7e8kio_yjISJdvA/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Bayesian Games</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1UYbm_nz4CUIYLGNW93L_h7ptEt_D55q_/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">solution</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iLlRTQGgSMv03OUAmsRmgeR-X8h70BoV/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Dynamic Bayesian Games</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CxHaUWeXm7u4cdplf0cKjqcCjhVkUtf1/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">solution</a>\n\n<strong>Mock Final Exams</strong><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1XPXUJmtOsuAcgsuaGgngO6qgu25UvzsW/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Mock Exam</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/18vAEhnLGBX0nk4fmOWCsdxhvx-nMS5pA/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">solutions</a>\n\n<strong>Difficult Mock Exams</strong><br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BT9bPS1eOn3xiwfBvdAswKXVqMYBoamr/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Shorter version</a> (40 minutes, up to strategic-form games)<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1N1su5VNG-U3SpkafbJZzxhm0OKgLCvDB/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">solution</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1SLbGlwEDs2dGSWr4p9AuiNQx_WjQB99Z/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Longer version</a> (80 minutes, comprehensive topic coverage)<br>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1hW2JRwNt6uYEVk_xE7j88REsnma9k7se/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">solution</a> (Updated on Dec. 13)\n",
  "originalMaterialsBody": "\n\nミクロ経済学関係の講義資料を共有しています。\n\nThis page lists course materials in Microeconomics courses.\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"course-guide\"><strong>日本語：</strong><a href=\"#intermediate-ja\">中級ミクロ経済学・ゲーム理論</a> ｜ <a href=\"#advanced-ja\">上級ミクロ経済学（準備中）</a><br><strong>English:</strong> <a href=\"#intermediate-en\">Intermediate Microeconomics</a> | <a href=\"#advanced-en\">Advanced Microeconomics</a></p>\n\n<h2 id=\"intermediate-ja\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">ミクロ経済学(学部中級レベル）</h2>\n\n対象授業: Microeconomics (GBC), ゲーム理論、ゲーム理論（帝塚山大学）。  \n対象読者: ミクロ経済学の初学者に、始めから丁寧にミクロ経済学の各トピックを解説することを目的としています。比較的平易な数学を使用していますが、適宜解説を理解すれば問題ありません。\n\n<strong>講義ノート（日本語）：</strong>  \n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1U7ds7kobftj2sipwcrcpnG6Nv3QsOPI5/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ミクロ経済学</a>（2026/04/15 新しいバージョンに差し替えました)\n\n<strong>練習問題・解答（日本語）：</strong>  \n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KvPLmJlfzTiw_JBXHtiHt5v4BYkrvB32/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">練習問題</a>  \n（注意：日本語のゲーム理論授業向けの練習問題です。GBCの練習問題は英語のほうを使ってください）  \n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NUqlwK-8_hE0O0V4j07TRYidi4on9Gw-/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">解答例</a>\n\n<strong>模擬試験・解答（日本語）：</strong>  \n<strong>兵庫県立大学ゲーム理論</strong>  \n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/176oFwCAaScBQMCuAg-jxad4AX0rynJAs/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">模擬試験</a>  \n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1bwig-BgS64h-Y-_9by9tpoawv5tsymzR/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">解答例</a>\n\n<a href=\"#course-guide\">科目一覧へ戻る / Back to course guide</a>\n\n<h2 id=\"intermediate-en\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Microeconomics (Intermediate Level)</h2>\n\nFor Microeconomics (GBC).  \nThe lecture notes aim to introduce microeconomics with readers of various backgrounds. While we use simple mathematics, the reader can understand the materials by reading the notes step by step.\n\n<strong>Lecture notes (English):</strong>  \n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1dx38qiGsn8UlhuvhwdWWJoQYDWqpum_C/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Microeconomics</a>\n\n<strong>Interactive materials:</strong>  \n<strong><a href=\"https://sisogai.github.io/teaching/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Interactive Visualizations (Prototype)</a></strong>\n\n<strong>Problem sets and solutions (English):</strong>  \n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QTHd1B04EECkH8JKAL-wJAVcFsUKKz3M/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Problem Sets</a>  \n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1z77qb2V5QpMjgrWvUcGuEeGbG9FzHgWA/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Solutions</a>\n\n<strong>Former exam and solutions (English):</strong>  \n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1vbM8VcpefXHNduN9DQTWFL32xQiN0fWY/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Former Final Exam (Microeconomics 2025)</a>  \n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BcipO73dnAImgC6H7H43hIV-QI4cRhj4/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Solutions</a>\n\n<strong>Mock exam and solutions (English):</strong>  \nMicroeconomics 2026 @UofHyogo  \n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1IjSkQdxLnQgUeYnLKSr0PkZxIYeqklBr/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mock Exam</a>  \n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1XIJiSpJkAUPeSXgBk0ykNKzhgNV0xeZj/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Solutions</a>\n\n<a href=\"#course-guide\">科目一覧へ戻る / Back to course guide</a>\n\n<h2 id=\"advanced-ja\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">上級ミクロ経済学（準備中）</h2>\n\n主な対象授業: Advanced Microeconomics (GBC)。  \n対象読者: 基本的なミクロ経済学を理解している読者に、より研究のフロンティアに近い内容を解説することを目指しています。これを読むことで、ミクロ経済学の研究論文を読めるようになることが期待できます。扱う数学は比較的高度なものですが、解説をきちんと理解していけば理解できるはずです。特に、<strong>学部生だから理解できないということは決してありません</strong>。\n\n<a href=\"#course-guide\">科目一覧へ戻る / Back to course guide</a>\n\n<h2 id=\"advanced-en\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Advanced Microeconomics</h2>\n\nFor Advanced Microeconomics (GBC) and Microeconomics (DGB).  \nThe notes aim to explain advanced research topics of microeconomics. After completing this notes, students will be able to start reading academic papers in microeconomics.\n\n<strong>Lecture notes (English):</strong>  \n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JVPARnzXDqNlv3Ewr6fj6nbWmA5_5jS8/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Advanced Microeconomics – Lecture Edition</a> (Please use this version for course preparation)  \n  \n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JH18W8vCnM4uhPPKJASs5zA8XV7zcJHz/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Advanced Microeconomics – Reference Edition</a> (If you aim to do research in microeconomics, consult this version)  \n<em>PDF revised: 2026/09/26</em>\n\nProblem Sets  \n<em>Link not listed / リンク未掲載</em>\n\n<a href=\"#course-guide\">科目一覧へ戻る / Back to course guide</a>\n",
